      "id": "quick-decision",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "直接判断：音频视频技术员把活动需求转成可验证的设备清单、信号流、测试结果、运行状态和撤场交接。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "适配信号：能画清信号流、逐段排障，并在倒计时和多人协作中准确报告状态。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "谨慎条件：若容易忽略临时改线、未知安全状态或交接记录，应先练习停止与升级。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "安全试做只使用本页四条虚构记录，不接电、不吊挂、不操作真实设备。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.profile",
      "id": "profile",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "身份：本页对应O*NET 27-4011.00，负责为现场或录制活动搭建、维护和拆除音频视频设备。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.profile.definition-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial",
            "onet-av"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.responsibilities-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              "输入：场地与节目需求、设备清单、端口与线缆、供电条件、信号格式、时间表和安全限制。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.profile.responsibilities-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial",
            "onet-av"
          ],
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.responsibilities-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              "任务：布置设备、连接信号、设置增益与同步、测试监听、运行监控、排障并撤场。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.profile.responsibilities-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial",
            "onet-av"
          ],
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.responsibilities-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              "产出：设备清单、信号流图、校准记录、运行日志、故障状态和撤场交接单。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.profile.responsibilities-block.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial",
            "onet-av"
          ],
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.work-context-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "关键判断：输入输出是否匹配、信号在哪一段丢失、主备切换是否可回退，以及何时因供电或吊挂状态不明而停止。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.profile.work-context-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial",
            "onet-av"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.work-context-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "流程：核需求与限制，清点设备，按图连接，逐段测试，运行监控，记录变更，安全下电并撤场。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.profile.work-context-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial",
            "onet-av"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.onet-structured-fields-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "工具：话筒、扬声器、调音台、接口、摄像机、显示器、服务器、线缆、测试信号与标签。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.profile.onet-structured-fields-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial",
            "onet-av"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-quick-answers-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "协作：与活动负责人、导演或内容团队、摄像、广播、场地电工、吊挂人员和下一班技术员交接。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.profile.career-quick-answers-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial",
            "onet-av"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-quick-answers-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "质量：声音和画面清晰稳定、同步正确、备用路径可用，变更和故障记录能够被下一班复现。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.profile.career-quick-answers-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial",
            "onet-av"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "边界：本岗位保证设备与信号可靠性，不自动承担节目导演、内容发布、电气维修或吊挂审批职责。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.profile.definition-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial",
            "onet-av"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
