            "paragraphs": [
              "采用前要核对输入数据、访问权限、资料版本和失败模式。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "告警聚类可帮助定位故障线索，但仍需逐段核验信号链。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "人员必须确认线缆、接口、电源和吊挂条件；工具输出不等于授权。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.5",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "未经复核的输出可能造成错误路由或设置；节目导演和内容发布仍属相应责任人。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.6",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "切换主备设备前要确认活动影响和回退路径；任务暴露、采用、生产率和就业是不同测量对象。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "audio-and-video-technicians.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.7",
          "source_refs": [
            "av-editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "先在可回滚、可审计的低风险步骤试用，再根据错误记录决定是否扩大。"
            ]
